Or you can email us civics101 at nhpr.org.

634
00:36:37,700 --> 00:36:41,940
And if you have listened long enough to hear me say this, I hope that means we are on the

635
00:36:41,940 --> 00:36:47,780
right track to journalism at its best. Serving you, serving democracy.

